{"seq":2,"slug":"network-optimization","title":"网络优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/network-optimization","wordCount":1272,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"网络优化\">网络优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>网络通信是分布式系统的基础，也是微服务架构中最常见的性能瓶颈。网络优化需要在<strong>延迟</strong>（单次请求的耗时）和<strong>吞吐量</strong>（单位时间传输的数据量）之间找到平衡。与磁盘 I/O 不同，网络性能受到物理距离、协议开销、拥塞控制和对端处理能力等多重因素的约束。优化策略需要覆盖从应用层协议到内核网络栈的完整链路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[网络性能优化] --&gt; B[应用层]&#10;    A --&gt; C[传输层]&#10;    A --&gt; D[架构层]&#10;    B --&gt; E[协议选择]&#10;    B --&gt; F[序列化优化]&#10;    B --&gt; G[连接管理]&#10;    C --&gt; H[TCP 参数调优]&#10;    C --&gt; I[拥塞控制]&#10;    D --&gt; J[CDN]&#10;    D --&gt; K[负载均衡]&#10;    D --&gt; L[就近部署]\">graph TB\n    A[网络性能优化] --&gt; B[应用层]\n    A --&gt; C[传输层]\n    A --&gt; D[架构层]\n    B --&gt; E[协议选择]\n    B --&gt; F[序列化优化]\n    B --&gt; G[连接管理]\n    C --&gt; H[TCP 参数调优]\n    C --&gt; I[拥塞控制]\n    D --&gt; J[CDN]\n    D --&gt; K[负载均衡]\n    D --&gt; L[就近部署]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>网络延迟来源</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>可优化空间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光速传播延迟 (跨大洲)</td>\n<td>50-150 ms</td>\n<td>就近部署、CDN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCP 握手</td>\n<td>1 RTT (三次握手)</td>\n<td>连接池、长连接、TFO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TLS 握手</td>\n<td>1-2 RTT</td>\n<td>TLS 1.3、会话恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNS 解析</td>\n<td>1-100 ms</td>\n<td>DNS 缓存、预解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内核协议栈处理</td>\n<td>5-50 μs</td>\n<td>Kernel bypass, XDP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层序列化</td>\n<td>1-100 μs</td>\n<td>Protocol Buffers, FlatBuffers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端处理</td>\n<td>1 ms - 数秒</td>\n<td>应用逻辑优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"tcp-参数调优\">TCP 参数调优</h2><p>TCP 是互联网的基础传输协议，其默认参数为通用场景设计。针对特定工作负载调优 TCP 参数可以显著提升网络性能。</p>\n<p><strong>发送和接收缓冲区</strong>决定了 TCP 窗口大小，直接影响高延迟网络上的吞吐量。根据带宽延迟积（BDP = 带宽 × RTT）设置缓冲区：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看当前 TCP 缓冲区设置&#10;sysctl net.ipv4.tcp_rmem  # 读缓冲区: min default max&#10;sysctl net.ipv4.tcp_wmem  # 写缓冲区: min default max&#10;&#10;# 优化高带宽高延迟网络 (10Gbps, 100ms RTT → BDP = 125MB)&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_rmem=&quot;4096 1048576 16777216&quot;&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_wmem=&quot;4096 1048576 16777216&quot;&#10;sysctl -w net.core.rmem_max=16777216&#10;sysctl -w net.core.wmem_max=16777216&#10;&#10;# 启用窗口缩放（默认已启用）&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_window_scaling=1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看当前 TCP 缓冲区设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_rmem</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 读缓冲区: min default max</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_wmem</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 写缓冲区: min default max</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 优化高带宽高延迟网络 (10Gbps, 100ms RTT → BDP = 125MB)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_rmem=\"4096 1048576 16777216\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_wmem=\"4096 1048576 16777216\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.core.rmem_max=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16777216</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.core.wmem_max=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16777216</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用窗口缩放（默认已启用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_window_scaling=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>连接管理</strong>参数影响服务器在高并发下的连接处理能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 增大连接队列&#10;sysctl -w net.core.somaxconn=65535         # listen() 队列最大长度&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_max_syn_backlog=65535  # SYN 队列长度&#10;&#10;# TIME_WAIT 优化&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_tw_reuse=1          # 允许复用 TIME_WAIT 连接&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_fin_timeout=15      # FIN_WAIT2 超时时间&#10;&#10;# 快速回收和保活&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_time=60   # 保活探测间隔&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_intvl=10  # 保活重试间隔&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_probes=6  # 保活重试次数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 增大连接队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.core.somaxconn=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">65535</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # listen() 队列最大长度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_max_syn_backlog=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">65535</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # SYN 队列长度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># TIME_WAIT 优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_tw_reuse=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 允许复用 TIME_WAIT 连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_fin_timeout=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # FIN_WAIT2 超时时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 快速回收和保活</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_time=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 保活探测间隔</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_intvl=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 保活重试间隔</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_probes=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 保活重试次数</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>拥塞控制算法</strong>决定了 TCP 在网络拥塞时的行为。不同算法适合不同的网络环境：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CUBIC</td>\n<td>Linux 默认，基于丢包的拥塞控制</td>\n<td>通用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BBR</td>\n<td>Google 开发，基于带宽估计</td>\n<td>高丢包率网络、长距离传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BBRv2</td>\n<td>BBR 改进版，更公平</td>\n<td>与 CUBIC 共存的混合网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCTCP</td>\n<td>数据中心优化，基于 ECN</td>\n<td>数据中心内部通信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 切换到 BBR&#10;sysctl -w net.core.default_qdisc=fq&#10;sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_congestion_control=bbr&#10;&#10;# 验证&#10;sysctl net.ipv4.tcp_congestion_control\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 切换到 BBR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.core.default_qdisc=fq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_congestion_control=bbr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> net.ipv4.tcp_congestion_control</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"连接池与多路复用\">连接池与多路复用</h2><p>每次 TCP 连接的建立需要三次握手（1 RTT），加上 TLS 握手可能需要额外 1-2 RTT。对于频繁的短连接请求，连接建立的开销可能占总延迟的 50% 以上。<strong>连接池</strong>（Connection Pool）通过复用已建立的连接来消除这个开销。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import (&#10;    &quot;net/http&quot;&#10;    &quot;time&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;var client = &amp;http.Client{&#10;    Transport: &amp;http.Transport{&#10;        MaxIdleConns:        100,&#10;        MaxIdleConnsPerHost: 20,&#10;        MaxConnsPerHost:     50,&#10;        IdleConnTimeout:     90 * time.Second,&#10;        DisableKeepAlives:   false,&#10;    },&#10;    Timeout: 30 * time.Second,&#10;}&#10;&#10;func makeRequest(url string) (*http.Response, error) {&#10;    return client.Do(&amp;http.Request{})  // 自动复用连接&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net/http</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Transport: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Transport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        MaxIdleConns:        </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        MaxIdleConnsPerHost: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        MaxConnsPerHost:     </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        IdleConnTimeout:     </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        DisableKeepAlives:   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Timeout: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Do</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{})  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动复用连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>HTTP/2 多路复用</strong>在单个 TCP 连接上并发传输多个请求/响应流，消除了 HTTP/1.1 的队头阻塞（Head-of-Line Blocking）问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph HTTP/1.1&#10;        A[请求1] --&gt; B[响应1]&#10;        B --&gt; C[请求2]&#10;        C --&gt; D[响应2]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph HTTP/2 多路复用&#10;        E[请求1] --&gt; G[响应1]&#10;        F[请求2] --&gt; H[响应2]&#10;        E --- F&#10;        G --- H&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph HTTP/1.1\n        A[请求1] --&gt; B[响应1]\n        B --&gt; C[请求2]\n        C --&gt; D[响应2]\n    end\n    subgraph HTTP/2 多路复用\n        E[请求1] --&gt; G[响应1]\n        F[请求2] --&gt; H[响应2]\n        E --- F\n        G --- H\n    end</pre><p>HTTP/3（基于 QUIC）在 UDP 之上实现可靠传输，进一步解决了 TCP 层的队头阻塞：当一个流的包丢失时，不影响其他流的传输。对于移动网络等高丢包环境，HTTP/3 比 HTTP/2 有显著优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"序列化与数据传输优化\">序列化与数据传输优化</h2><p>网络传输的数据需要序列化（编码为字节流）和反序列化（解码为结构体）。序列化格式的选择直接影响 CPU 开销和传输数据量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>编码速度</th>\n<th>解码速度</th>\n<th>数据大小</th>\n<th>可读性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>大（文本）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Protocol Buffers</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>小（二进制）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FlatBuffers</td>\n<td>极快（零拷贝）</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MessagePack</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cap&#39;n Proto</td>\n<td>极快（零拷贝）</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"// Protocol Buffers 定义&#10;syntax = &quot;proto3&quot;;&#10;&#10;message UserResponse {&#10;    int64 id = 1;&#10;    string name = 2;&#10;    string email = 3;&#10;    repeated Order orders = 4;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message Order {&#10;    int64 id = 1;&#10;    double amount = 2;&#10;    int64 timestamp = 3;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Protocol Buffers 定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>syntax = \"proto3\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message UserResponse {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int64 id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    string name = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    string email = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeated Order orders = 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message Order {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int64 id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    double amount = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int64 timestamp = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>数据压缩</strong>是减少传输量的直接手段。在 CPU 充裕但带宽有限的场景下，压缩可以显著提升有效吞吐量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# HTTP 响应压缩（Nginx 配置）&#10;gzip on;&#10;gzip_types text/plain application/json application/javascript;&#10;gzip_min_length 1024;&#10;gzip_comp_level 6;&#10;&#10;# 使用 Brotli（比 gzip 压缩率高 15-25%）&#10;brotli on;&#10;brotli_types text/plain application/json;&#10;brotli_comp_level 6;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># HTTP 响应压缩（Nginx 配置）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gzip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gzip_types</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> text/plain</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> application/json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> application/javascript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gzip_min_length</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gzip_comp_level</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 Brotli（比 gzip 压缩率高 15-25%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brotli</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brotli_types</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> text/plain</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> application/json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brotli_comp_level</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>减少传输数据量</strong>的应用层策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>字段过滤</strong>：GraphQL 或 REST 的 <code>?fields=id,name</code> 参数，只返回需要的字段</li>\n<li><strong>增量传输</strong>：使用 ETag/Last-Modified 条件请求，返回 304 避免传输未变更的数据</li>\n<li><strong>分页</strong>：避免一次返回所有结果，使用游标分页控制每次返回量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"nagle-算法与延迟优化\">Nagle 算法与延迟优化</h2><p>Nagle 算法合并小包以减少网络中的小包数量，但会引入最多 200ms 的延迟。对于实时性要求高的应用（如游戏、交易系统、交互式 SSH），应该禁用 Nagle 算法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#include &lt;netinet/tcp.h&gt;&#10;&#10;int flag = 1;&#10;setsockopt(sockfd, IPPROTO_TCP, TCP_NODELAY, &amp;flag, sizeof(flag));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;netinet/tcp.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setsockopt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sockfd, IPPROTO_TCP, TCP_NODELAY, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">flag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(flag));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与 Nagle 算法相关的是 <strong>TCP_CORK</strong>（Linux）/TCP_NOPUSH（BSD），它将多次 write() 的数据积攒到一起，在解除 CORK 后一次性发送。适用于明确知道数据边界的场景（如 HTTP 响应 = Headers + Body）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"int cork = 1;&#10;setsockopt(sockfd, IPPROTO_TCP, TCP_CORK, &amp;cork, sizeof(cork));&#10;&#10;write(sockfd, http_headers, headers_len);&#10;write(sockfd, http_body, body_len);&#10;&#10;cork = 0;&#10;setsockopt(sockfd, IPPROTO_TCP, TCP_CORK, &amp;cork, sizeof(cork));&#10;// 此时内核会将 headers 和 body 合并为一个 TCP 段发送\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cork </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setsockopt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sockfd, IPPROTO_TCP, TCP_CORK, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cork));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sockfd, http_headers, headers_len);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sockfd, http_body, body_len);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cork </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setsockopt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sockfd, IPPROTO_TCP, TCP_CORK, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cork));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 此时内核会将 headers 和 body 合并为一个 TCP 段发送</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TCP_NODELAY</td>\n<td>禁用 Nagle，立即发送</td>\n<td>低延迟交互（游戏、终端）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TCP_CORK</td>\n<td>积攒数据，手动触发发送</td>\n<td>组合多个 write 为一个包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认 (Nagle on)</td>\n<td>小包合并，200ms 超时</td>\n<td>带宽敏感的批量传输</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((网络优化))&#10;    TCP 调优&#10;      缓冲区大小&#10;      拥塞控制 BBR&#10;      连接管理参数&#10;    连接管理&#10;      连接池&#10;      HTTP/2 多路复用&#10;      HTTP/3 QUIC&#10;    数据传输&#10;      序列化格式&#10;      压缩&#10;      字段过滤&#10;      增量传输&#10;    延迟优化&#10;      TCP_NODELAY&#10;      TCP_CORK&#10;      TLS 1.3&#10;      DNS 预解析\">mindmap\n  root((网络优化))\n    TCP 调优\n      缓冲区大小\n      拥塞控制 BBR\n      连接管理参数\n    连接管理\n      连接池\n      HTTP/2 多路复用\n      HTTP/3 QUIC\n    数据传输\n      序列化格式\n      压缩\n      字段过滤\n      增量传输\n    延迟优化\n      TCP_NODELAY\n      TCP_CORK\n      TLS 1.3\n      DNS 预解析</pre><ul>\n<li>TCP 参数调优的核心是<strong>匹配网络环境</strong>：缓冲区大小由 BDP 决定，BBR 适合高丢包网络</li>\n<li><strong>连接池</strong>消除重复的握手开销，<strong>HTTP/2 多路复用</strong>在单连接上并行传输多个流</li>\n<li><strong>序列化格式</strong>选择影响 CPU 和带宽：JSON 适合调试，Protobuf/FlatBuffers 适合生产</li>\n<li><strong>TCP_NODELAY</strong> 对低延迟场景至关重要——禁用 Nagle 算法避免小包延迟</li>\n<li>网络优化的优先级：<strong>减少 RTT 次数 &gt; 减少传输量 &gt; 增大吞吐量 &gt; 降低单包延迟</strong></li>\n<li>在分布式系统中，网络延迟的变异性往往比均值更影响用户体验——关注 P99 延迟</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网络优化","id":"网络优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TCP 参数调优","id":"tcp-参数调优"},{"level":2,"text":"连接池与多路复用","id":"连接池与多路复用"},{"level":2,"text":"序列化与数据传输优化","id":"序列化与数据传输优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Nagle 算法与延迟优化","id":"nagle-算法与延迟优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"磁盘 I/O 优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/disk-io-optimization"},"next":{"title":"异步 I/O 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/async-io-patterns"}}